{
  "_comment": "Real Clash Royale mechanics + stats at Tournament Standard (level 11). Units: elixir, hp, damage/hit, hit_speed s, load_time s (first-hit delay), range/sight/collision_radius/splash_radius/radius tiles, speed tiles/s (Slow .75, Med 1.0, Fast 1.5, VeryFast 2.0), mass push-weight, deploy_time s, lifetime s. targets ground|air|both. target_buildings_only. invisible:true (untargetable except in a brief post-attack reveal window; splash/area still hits). jumps_river. shield hp. charge{min_distance,speed_mult,damage_mult}. dash{min,max,speed(tiles/s),invuln,damage_mult,cooldown(s),land_damage,land_radius} = Bandit dash / Mega Knight jump. snare s (on-hit snare via slow). dies_on_hit (self-destruct on connect -> death_spawn, e.g. Battle Ram). suicide:true = kamikaze unit that lands its splash (+ optional stun) once on contact then dies (Fire/Ice/Electro Spirit, Wall Breakers). death_area{effect,radius,duration,power} = drop an area effect on death (Lumberjack Rage). spawn{card,count,interval} = periodic spawner. death_spawn{card,count} = spawn on death (chains: a death-spawned unit may have its own death_spawn, e.g. elixir_golem -> golemites -> blobs). revive{card,hp_pct} = on a LIFETIME-EXPIRY death only, hatch one `card` at hp_pct% of its hp, once (Phoenix egg -> reborn Phoenix; the reborn never revives/splits again). RAMP/SIEGE: ramp_damage[]=per-stage per-hit damage while locked on one target + ramp_stage_time s per stage (Inferno; resets on retarget/stun). charge_time s = long reload that charges one big shot, reset if stunned (Sparky). min_range tiles = siege dead zone (Mortar). prefers_buildings = building/tower target priority (X-Bow). ECONOMY: elixir_per_pulse + elixir_pulse_interval s = building that grants ITS OWNER elixir each pulse (Elixir Collector; respects the 10 cap). mirror:true = replays the owner's last-deployed card at +1 elixir (resolved at deploy). CHAMPION: champion:true marks a Champion troop (max one per deck) with an activatable ability{kind,cost,cooldown,duration,damage,count,summon,range,radius} fired via Battle.activate_ability(player) or step slot ABILITY_SLOT: kind cloak = untargetable + attack/move boost for duration; summon = spawn count summon-units; dash = teleport to nearest enemy over range tiles, hitting the line for damage. Spell: effect poison|rage|heal|freeze|slow|tornado + effect_duration + effect_interval + effect_power; crown_tower_damage_pct. knockback tiles = push distance on hit (heavy/anchored resist). pierce + roll_range tiles = a rolling-line projectile that rolls through enemies (Log, Bowler). tornado effect pulls enemies toward center each tick + small DoT. EVOLUTION: a base card with evolved:<name> + evo_cycles:<n> charges by being cycled n times, then its next play spawns the evolved variant (deployable:false) and the counter resets. deployable:false = summon-only (not deck-legal). This is an accurate, extensible subset; numbers verify against decoded tables for exact per-patch parity.",
